{"id": "33942", "title": "糊涂新娘(魔咒物语2)", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 56, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33942.htm", "intro": "她这个糊涂蛋的二十二岁生日礼物，就是梦想中的美国半月游，前一秒才对妈咪拍胸脯保证一切安啦，下一秒就暗暗大叫一声：惨！接她的表姊嘟嘟好出差去了，联络人的记事本嘟嘟好没带到，快演出“肥猫流浪记”时，还好有一个帅得叫人流口水的男人，闪著“救世主”的光芒降临，帅帅的他不仅替她处理危机，还邀她共游美丽西雅图，但爱情的火花都还没啪滋点燃，她就吃他前女友的醋，喝醉把他扑上床，隔天人也醒、酒也醒的她没脸见人啦……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33942", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2157994.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2157995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2157996.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2157997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2157998.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2157999.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2158000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2158001.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2158002.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2158003.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2158004.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2158005.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2158006.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2158007.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2158008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2158009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2158010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2158011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2158012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2158013.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2158014.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2158015.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2158016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2158017.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2158018.html", "available":